    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:haggadah:magid/rabbi_eliezer_omar">
        <tei:milestone unit="paragraph" n="1" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:haggadah:magid/rabbi_eliezer_omar/1"/>
        <tei:p>Rabbi Eliezer said: How do we know that each and every plague that the blessed Holy One brought against the Egyptians in Egypt consisted of four plagues? Scripture says: “He sent against them his burning anger, wrath, fury, distress, and messengers of evil.”[35] Psalms 78:49 “Wrath”: One [plague]. “Fury”: Two [plagues]. “Distress”: Three [plagues]. “Messengers of evil”: Four [plagues]. Thus, in Egypt they were afflicted with forty plagues, and on the sea they were afflicted with two hundred plagues.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
